  m_Name: RaskReliquary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Rask Reliquary
  role: 3
  description: 'A shrine on tracks: a light Rask vehicle carrying a holy relic beneath
    a gilded canopy into battle. It has no weapon of its own, but its Sanctifying
    Presence gives every other friendly Biological soldier within 20 m +2 damage
    and +20% accuracy (not vehicles or robots), enough to turn a swarm of Rask riflemen
    into a killing field. With 10 health and Armor Level 2 it''s fragile for a vehicle,
    and it moves only 20 m (it can''t sprint, being Mechanical), so keep it behind
    your lines and in the middle of your army. A Specialist: you can field more than
    one. Its Supply Cost includes a +100 surcharge for the aura.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4fb73c8cb4634143bd7489999bf268f, type: 2}
